# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system 5c6c21135126940715c839c3ec9f7ae46a3db0f45b221095c293aacea1f50a39
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server eaddbd8891acc12877d70e5dd8831adb6ae1e8020edbefd8f5b7b633e05e63d4
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm d73dd1492b4fea9b0cbabf5ce9f7b92ee7528dd9d4fa2d6c7cd40bd050377fbe
